[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1309","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3153","title":"Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client for Windows 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client for Windows 的安装程序组件存在目录路径处理不当漏洞。经本地身份验证的攻击者可利用该漏洞将用户提供的文件复制到具有系统级别权限的系统目录中。攻击者通过在 Windows 系统上创建恶意文件并利用此漏洞将其复制到系统目录，可实现 DLL 预加载、DLL 劫持等相关攻击，最终获取系统级别权限。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有目标 Windows 系统的有效本地凭据才能利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3153"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-19T20:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:17:28Z","remediation":"将 Cisco AnyConnect Secure Mobility Client for Windows 升级至 4.8.02042 或更高版本。升级前请确认目标系统已具备足够内存并满足新版本的硬件及软件兼容性要求，升级操作可通过 AnyConnect 的自动更新机制或手动下载最新安装包完成。升级后重启 Cisco AnyConnect 服务以确保修复生效。由于该漏洞的安装程序组件在处理目录路径时存在缺陷，且官方未提供任何临时缓解措施，必须通过版本升级彻底修复。如无法立即升级，应限制对受影响 Windows 系统的本地用户访问权限，降低被本地攻击者利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157340/Cisco-AnyConnect-Secure-Mobility-Client-4.8.01090-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/158219/Cisco-AnyConnect-Path-Traversal-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159420/Cisco-AnyConnect-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Apr/43","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-ac-win-path-traverse-qO4HWBsj","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3153","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3153.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/9f2a6e9f8ef80998f730c790dd18087952b57414/2020/CVE-2020-3153.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3153.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/929b6ea1a1a05b6cd00f9afcd22053f36ec0c5dc/modules/exploits/windows/local/anyconnect_lpe.rb","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2020/3xxx/CVE-2020-3153.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2015/CVE-2015-6305.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3153.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3153.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-3153.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-3153.md","https://github.com/goichot/CVE-2020-3153","https://github.com/shubham0d/CVE-2020-3153","https://github.com/raspberry-pie/CVE-2020-3153"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1777","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-7796","title":"Zimbra Collaboration Suite 服务器端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Zimbra Collaboration Suite (ZCS) 8.8.15 Patch 7 之前版本存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。当目标系统安装了 WebEx zimlet 且启用了 zimlet JSP 功能时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制请求，利用该漏洞诱使服务器向任意内部或外部地址发起 HTTP 请求，从而绕过访问控制、读取敏感信息或进一步探测攻击内网服务。该漏洞影响部署了 WebEx 插件的 Zimbra 协作套件，CVSS v3.1 评分 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-7796"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-18T22:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:25:27Z","remediation":"立即将 Zimbra Collaboration Suite 升级至 8.8.15 Patch 7 或更高版本。升级前请先完整备份系统数据并按照官方说明执行补丁安装，安装完成后以 zimbra 用户身份执行 zmcontrol restart 重启所有服务使补丁生效。如暂无法升级，若不需要使用 WebEx zimlet，可通过 zmlocalconfig -e zimlet_webex_enabled=false 禁用该 zimlet，或在 zimlet 配置中关闭 JSP 功能以临时缓解 SSRF 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Releases/8.8.15/P7","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-7796","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-7796.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-7796.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-7796.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2020-7796.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-7796-5255.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-7796-5256.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-7796/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2020-7796.py","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2020/7xxx/CVE-2020-7796.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Zimbra Collaboration Suite/CVE-2020-7796.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2020/CVE-2020-7796.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2020-7796.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1777.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0022","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0688","title":"Microsoft Exchange 验证密钥远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Server 在处理内存对象时存在验证密钥远程代码执行漏洞（CWE-287）。由于 Exchange 在安装时生成的验证密钥（ValidationKey）和脱敏密钥（DecryptionKey）在所有同版本服务器中相同，已认证的攻击者可利用该固定密钥构造恶意 ViewState 数据，通过 Exchange 控制面板（ECP）发送特制请求触发.NET反序列化，从而在目标服务器上以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码。攻击者只需拥有 Exchange 有效用户凭据即可远程利用，无需用户交互。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Exchange Server 2010/2013/2016/2019 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即安装补丁或按官方指南更换唯一验证密钥。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0688"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-11T22:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:21Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 2 月安全更新 KB4536987：Exchange Server 2016 CU14/CU15 和 Exchange Server 2019 CU3/CU4 均需更新至对应补丁版本。建议以管理员身份运行命令提示符后执行 .msp 安装包，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可在 ECP 虚拟目录上配置 IP 地址和域名访问限制，仅允许受信任的管理员网络段访问 /ecp 路径，同时启用多因素认证（MFA）降低凭据泄露后的利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156592/Microsoft-Exchange-2019-15.2.221.12-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156620/Exchange-Control-Panel-Viewstate-Deserialization.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0688","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-20-258/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0688","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48153","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/0x783kb/Threat-Analysis-Handbook/blob/c35524f11e7cd0fdd97596792dc2883cedbfa69b/Web/2020/T1190-CVE-2020-0688-Exchange漏洞利用检测.md","https://github.com/tijldeneut/Security/blob/24b4cbd974d39d7c4ff1ae31bed41b3522106994/CVE-2020-0688.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/by-cve/CVE-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/2020/CVE-2020-0688-zyn3rgy_ecp_slap.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/2020/CVE-2020-0688-MrTiz_CVE-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/2020/CVE-2020-0688-Ridter_cve-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/2020/CVE-2020-0688-zcgonvh_CVE-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/2020/CVE-2020-0688-youncyb_CVE-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/8d07b4d37f136d2395dbbe7a1283e824ff6f840b/data/2020/CVE-2020-0688-ktpdpro_CVE-2020-0688.md","https://github.com/zcgonvh/CVE-2020-0688","https://github.com/Ridter/cve-2020-0688","https://github.com/random-robbie/cve-2020-0688","https://github.com/Yt1g3r/CVE-2020-0688_EXP","https://github.com/Jumbo-WJB/CVE-2020-0688"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0022.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0011","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0683","title":"Microsoft Windows Installer 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows Installer 在处理 MSI 包时未能正确解析符号链接，存在特权提升漏洞。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造恶意的 MSI 安装包，利用符号链接指向高权限可访问的文件或目录，从而在 SYSTEM 权限下执行任意操作。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本，攻击者成功利用后可完全控制系统，包括安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0683"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-11T22:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:20Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 2 月安全更新：Windows 7/Server 2008 R2 用户安装 KB4537820（月度汇总）或 KB4537813（安全仅更新）；Windows 10/Server 2016/2019 用户安装对应版本的 2020-02 累积更新。该漏洞源于 Windows Installer 在处理 MSI 包符号链接时未正确验证权限，攻击者登录后即可提权至 SYSTEM。如无法立即打补丁，可限制非管理员用户安装 MSI 包的权限，通过组策略启用「始终以提升的权限进行安装」为禁用状态，并移除受影响的 Trusted Installer 写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0683","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0683","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48079","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0683.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2020-0683/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2020-0683/README_EN.md","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2020-0683.cs","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/Windows10Exploits/blob/9790226d07e5285143c3531bc9797a609a83162b/Undefined/CVE-2020-0683/README.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/vulbase/blob/153d4a90a23af10f17ca0a65fb50f12b2f91edfc/edge/Edge_Security/Windows Install(WMI)越权漏洞（CVE-2020-0683).md","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2020-0683/README.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【文库】edge狼组/Edge_Security/Windows Install(WMI)越权漏洞（CVE-2020-0683).md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0683.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0686.md","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation","https://github.com/padovah4ck/CVE-2020-0683"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0009","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0674","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer JScript 引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 的脚本引擎 JScript.dll 在处理内存对象时存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制网站，诱使用户通过 IE 浏览器访问，触发脚本引擎对已释放内存的非法访问，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Internet Explorer 11 及 Windows 系统的 WPAD 服务，已发现在野利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已于 2020 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0674"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-11T22:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:19Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 2 月安全更新（对应 Windows 10 版本 1909/1903 为 KB4537767，Windows Server 2019/Windows 10 1809 为 KB4537776，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 为 KB4537789，Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 为 KB4537820），可通过 Windows Update 自动获取。如无法立即打补丁，可配置 IE 增强安全配置（ESC）限制 ActiveX 脚本执行，或在组策略中将 Internet Explorer 的\"允许运行脚本\"设置为\"禁用\"作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159137/Microsoft-Internet-Explorer-11-Use-After-Free.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161309/Microsoft-Internet-Explorer-11-Use-After-Free.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162565/Microsoft-Internet-Explorer-8-11-Use-After-Free.html","https://github.com/maxpl0it/CVE-2020-0674-Exploit","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0674","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0674","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49863","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/Windows10Exploits/blob/9790226d07e5285143c3531bc9797a609a83162b/Undefined/CVE-2020-0674/README.MD","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0711.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0713.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0712.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0710.md","https://github.com/forrest-orr/DoubleStar/blob/e25459a1119ee7d805a3ee4d1ee19f1ef64d7993/CVE-2020-0674/Forrest_Orr_CVE-2020-0674_64-bit.html","https://github.com/forrest-orr/DoubleStar","https://github.com/forrest-orr/Exploits","https://github.com/Neko-chanQwQ/CVE-2020-0674-PoC","https://github.com/Ken-Abruzzi/CVE-2020-0674"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0006","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0618","title":"Microsoft SQL Server Reporting Services 远程执行代码漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server Reporting Services（SSRS）在错误处理页面请求时存在反序列化漏洞（CWE-502）。已认证的远程攻击者可向目标 SSRS 服务器发送特制的页面请求，触发不安全的 .NET 反序列化，从而在目标系统上以 SSRS 服务账户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 2008/2012/2014/2016/2017 等多个版本的 Reporting Services，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 2 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0618"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-11T22:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 2 月安全更新，具体补丁编号对应 SQL Server 版本：SQL Server 2012 SP4 (KB4532097)、SQL Server 2014 SP3 (KB4532098)、SQL Server 2016 SP2 (KB4532099)。如无法立即打补丁，可在 IIS 中限制对 ReportServer 虚拟目录的访问权限，仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并禁用 SSRS 中不必要的自定义身份验证扩展作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156707/SQL-Server-Reporting-Services-SSRS-ViewState-Deserialization.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/159216/Microsoft-SQL-Server-Reporting-Services-2016-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0618","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0618","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48816","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-0618.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0618.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2020/CVE-2020-0618.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-0618.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2020-0618.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-0618-4339.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-0618-4334.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-0618-4337.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2020-0618-4338.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2020-0618.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/ARPSyndicate/nuclei/cvescan/high/CVE-2020-0618.yaml","https://github.com/euphrat1ca/CVE-2020-0618","https://github.com/wortell/cve-2020-0618","https://github.com/itstarsec/CVE-2020-0618","https://github.com/N3xtGenH4cker/CVE-2020-0618_DETECTION"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0006.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0006.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1308","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-3118","title":"Cisco IOS XR 发现协议远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS XR Software 的 Cisco Discovery Protocol (CDP) 实现存在输入验证缺陷。未经身份认证的相邻攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的恶意 CDP 数据包，触发栈溢出并最终以管理权限执行任意代码或导致设备重载。该漏洞影响支持 CDP 的 Cisco IOS XR 设备，CVSS 评分 8.8。由于 CDP 为二层协议，攻击者必须与目标设备处于同一广播域（二层相邻）方可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-3118"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-05T18:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:17:23Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Cisco IOS XR Software 安全修复版本：Release 6.6.3（非白盒平台）或 Release 6.6.12（白盒平台），以及 Release 7.0.2 或更高版本；受影响的早期版本可安装对应平台的软件维护升级（SMU），如 NCS6K 平台安装 ncs6k-5.2.5.CSCvr78185、ASR9K-PX 平台安装 asr9k-px-6.4.2.CSCvr78185 等。如无法立即升级，可在全局配置模式下执行 no cdp 命令禁用 Cisco Discovery Protocol，或在接口配置模式下执行 no cdp 关闭单个接口的 CDP 功能，以缩小攻击面，并提交更改保存配置。建议同时通过 show running-config | include cdp 命令确认 CDP 已正确禁用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156203/Cisco-Discovery-Protocol-CDP-Remote-Device-Takeover.html","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20200205-iosxr-cdp-rce","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-3118","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-3118.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-3118.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-3118.md","https://github.com/8lu3sh311/CVE-PoC/blob/0e321f89a2ba216d8a7eb6eb28590d1dc39a74c9/2020/CVE-2020-3118.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-3118.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-3118.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/355cb847bc4d33c37a7ff6bd602777a6d36f0eed/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2020-3118","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-3118.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2020/CVE-2020-3118/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2020/CVE-2020-3118/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1709","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-7247","title":"OpenBSD OpenSMTPD 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2020-7247是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-7247"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-29T16:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:24:35Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSMTPD 至 6.6.2 或更高版本，以修复 smtp_mailaddr 函数中输入验证逻辑缺陷。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或访问控制层面限制 SMTP 服务的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并审查 /etc/mail/smtpd.conf 默认配置，删除或注释掉不必要的未授权访问规则，同时启用 SMTP 会话日志监控异常 MAIL FROM 命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156137/OpenBSD-OpenSMTPD-Privilege-Escalation-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156145/OpenSMTPD-6.6.2-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156249/OpenSMTPD-MAIL-FROM-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156295/OpenSMTPD-6.6.1-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162093/OpenBSD-OpenSMTPD-6.6-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Jan/49","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2020/01/28/3","https://github.com/openbsd/src/commit/9dcfda045474d8903224d175907bfc29761dcb45","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/OPH4QU4DNVHA7ACFXMYFCEP5PSXXPN4E/","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2020/Jan/51","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4268-1/","https://www.debian.org/security/2020/dsa-4611","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/390745","https://www.openbsd.org/security.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-7247","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48051","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2020/CVE-2020-7247.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/OpenSMTPD 远程命令执行漏洞 CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/opensmtpd/CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/middleware/OpenSMTPD-远程命令执行漏洞-CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/afe20f4bdb52ae870e113add0571518dc2153513/2020/7xxx/CVE-2020-7247.json","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/OpenSMTPD/CVE-2020-7247/README.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/4b2b5b9de550f9fd0e6819710aea6e044dfbc047/data/by-cve/CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/fb5f206c909d2a25672d2f7083207d9364c4215a/2020/CVE-2020-7247.json","https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/decret/blob/3fefd80a3bd199f29dfb048befb6ad8339d87b03/examples/CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/4b2b5b9de550f9fd0e6819710aea6e044dfbc047/data/2020/CVE-2020-7247-r0lh_CVE-2020-7247.md","https://github.com/FiroSolutions/cve-2020-7247-exploit","https://github.com/QTranspose/CVE-2020-7247-exploit","https://github.com/r0lh/CVE-2020-7247","https://github.com/superzerosec/cve-2020-7247","https://github.com/presentdaypresenttime/shai_hulud"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1109","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-2555","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server T3反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 中的 Oracle Coherence 组件（Caching、CacheStore、Invocation）存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过 T3 协议向目标发送特制的序列化数据，利用 ReflectionExtractor 类在反序列化过程中调用任意方法，实现未经身份认证的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0 及 Coherence 3.7.1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。Oracle 已在 2020 年第一季度安全更新中发布补丁修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-2555"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-15T17:15:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:12:20Z","remediation":"立即安装 Oracle 2020 年 1 月关键补丁更新（CPUJan2020）中针对 Coherence 组件的补丁，具体补丁编号请登录 My Oracle Support 查询对应版本。若无法立即打补丁，可在 WebLogic 控制台或通过配置文件禁用 T3 协议：在 `setDomainEnv.sh` 中添加 `-Dweblogic.rjvm.enableprotocols=false` 启动参数，或在防火墙层面阻止 T3 默认端口 7001 的入站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157054/Oracle-Coherence-Fusion-Middleware-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157207/Oracle-WebLogic-Server-12.2.1.4.0-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157795/WebLogic-Server-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2020.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2020.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-2555","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48508","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49485","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-2555.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2020-2555.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2020-2555_cmd.py","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-2555——Coherence_反序列化初探.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Weblogic_CVE-2020-2555_反序列化RCE_EXP构造_-_Y4er的博客.md","https://github.com/nu11secur1ty/Windows10Exploits/blob/9790226d07e5285143c3531bc9797a609a83162b/Undefined/CVE-2020-2555/README.md","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/WebLogic/CVE-2020-2555/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-2555.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2020/CVE-2020-2555/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-2556.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub","https://github.com/zhzyker/vulmap","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/Y4er/CVE-2020-2555","https://github.com/zzwlpx/weblogicPoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1108","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-2551","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server IIOP协议反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 的 WLS 核心组件中存在 IIOP 协议反序列化漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 IIOP 协议向目标服务器发送特制的序列化数据触发反序列化操作，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.3.0 及 12.2.1.4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何权限和用户交互，仅需网络访问即可完全接管目标服务器。Oracle 已在 2020 年 1 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-2551"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-15T17:15:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:12:20Z","remediation":"立即登录 My Oracle Support 下载并安装 Oracle 2020 年 1 月关键补丁更新（Critical Patch Update）中针对 WebLogic Server 的安全补丁。受影响版本包括 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.3.0 和 12.2.1.4.0。如无法立即打补丁，可在 WebLogic 管理控制台中禁用 IIOP 协议（将 weblogic.iiop.enabled 设为 false），或在网络防火墙层面阻止对 IIOP 默认端口（7001）的入站访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-2551","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-2551.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-2551.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2020-2551_poc.py","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-25514.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-25515.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2020-2551.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Weblogic_CVE-2020-2551_漏洞复现_and_CS_实战利用.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Weblogic_CVE-2020-2551_IIOP协议反序列化RCE_-_Y4er的博客.md","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/Weblogic/CVE-2020-2551/README.md","https://github.com/orleven/Tentacle/blob/bc01b3d0d2f9a6117132f40e9098a16180335454/script/vul/weblogic/CVE-2020-2551.py","https://github.com/hktalent/CVE-2020-2551/blob/353fa7b43c328bccb865e394c20ef11c574b6faf/CVE-2020-2551.py","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/Y4er/CVE-2020-2551","https://github.com/hktalent/CVE-2020-2551","https://github.com/zzwlpx/weblogicPoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0008","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0646","title":"Microsoft SharePoint .NET Framework 远程代码执行漏洞","description":".NET Framework 的 XOML 解析器在处理 SharePoint 工作流时存在代码注入漏洞，由于未能正确验证用户输入，导致攻击者可构造特制的 XOML 文件注入恶意代码。远程攻击者只需向目标 SharePoint 服务器发送包含恶意 XOML 的请求即可触发该漏洞，无需任何身份认证。成功利用后攻击者可实现远程代码执行，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 Microsoft .NET Framework 4.6/4.7/4.8 及 SharePoint 相关组件，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0646"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-14T23:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:15Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 1 月安全更新，为受影响 Windows 版本上的 .NET Framework 4.6/4.7/4.8 打补丁，通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取更新。对于 SharePoint 环境，作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web.config 中禁用 Workflow XOML 解析功能，限制非信任用户提交工作流定义。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156930/SharePoint-Workflows-XOML-Injection.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0646","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0646","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48275","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/code/cves/2020/CVE-2020-0646.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0646.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/code/cves/2020/CVE-2020-0646.yaml","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-0646_SharePoint_RCE_-_POC.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2020-0646 SharePoint RCE - POC.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0646.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0646.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-0646.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-0646.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0646.md","https://github.com/shengshengli/vulnerability-paper/blob/356d4303c0ab4465259ea068b0de38b4fade9be3/bugs/CVE-2020-0646 SharePoint RCE - POC.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-0008.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-0008.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0007","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0638","title":"微软 Windows 更新通知管理器特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 更新通知管理器（Update Notification Manager）在处理文件时存在权限提升漏洞，源于其对文件路径的解析验证不充分，攻击者可通过符号链接（symlink）劫持等方式操纵文件操作。该漏洞允许已获得目标系统低权限执行环境的本地攻击者将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，从而实现完全控制受感染系统。此漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，属于高危等级。攻击者需先在目标系统上获得用户级代码执行权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0638"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-14T23:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:13Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 1 月安全更新 (KB4534273 for Windows 10 1909/1903, KB4534271 for Windows Server 2019/2016, KB4534310 for Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略禁用 \"Windows Update Notification Manager\" 服务 (wuauserv 相关触发器) 作为临时缓解措施，并限制本地低权限用户的文件写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-0638","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-0638","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2020/CVE-2020-0638.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0638.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/380f533205c12eeaa5a8c27e3ae790586a72a402/2020/0xxx/CVE-2020-0638.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-0638.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-0638.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-0638.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-0638.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-0638.json","https://github.com/S3cur3Th1sSh1t/WinPwn/blob/cba1769c2d425a4ddeaae63d7c4441e53be59092/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2020-0638.json","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0005","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-0601","title":"Microsoft Windows CryptoAPI 椭圆曲线加密证书欺骗漏洞","description":"Windows CryptoAPI（Crypt32.dll）在验证椭圆曲线加密（ECC）证书时存在欺骗漏洞。攻击者可通过精心构造的 ECC 公钥和曲线参数生成伪造的代码签名证书，用于签署恶意可执行文件，使其看似来自受信任的合法来源。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本，包括 Windows 10 和 Windows Server 2016/2019。攻击者需要诱使用户运行恶意程序（用户交互），无需身份认证即可远程利用。CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2020-0601"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-14T23:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:46:08Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 1 月安全更新（KB4534271 适用于 Windows 10 v1903/v1909，KB4534297 适用于 Windo